1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,296
Hello, Anna! How are you?

2
00:00:03,296 --> 00:00:06,020
Good, thanks! And you?

3
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:08,877
Good too. What would you like to drink?

4
00:00:08,877 --> 00:00:11,692
I would like a tea, please.

5
00:00:11,692 --> 00:00:14,105
With milk or without milk?

6
00:00:14,105 --> 00:00:15,781
Without milk. And you?

7
00:00:15,781 --> 00:00:18,494
I will have a coffee with milk.

8
00:00:18,494 --> 00:00:21,347
Would you also like a cake?

9
00:00:21,347 --> 00:00:24,392
Yes, please. I am hungry.

10
00:00:24,392 --> 00:00:27,217
Me too. The cake is good!

11
00:00:27,217 --> 00:00:29,251
Is your tea hot?

12
00:00:29,251 --> 00:00:31,348
Yes. I will wait a little longer.
